@startuml policy_runtime
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Frozen policy - exact permit, reconstruction, ACK and one admission
start
:Bind model / history / side / original deadlines / ACKed RNG;
:Receive exact owner-issued permit before preparing policy inputs;
:Enumerate and encode only recipient facts;
:Score through immutable native model;
:Choose frozen argmax or one verified sampling draw;
:Return compact tentative journal before permit deadline;
:Owner reconstructs all decision facts under whole-job deadline;
if (Exact match?) then (yes)
  :ACK exact journal and commit known RNG prefix;
  :Release recomputed features to Burn accumulation;
  :Release selected actions to exactly one private admission;
else (no)
  :Abort without reward, update, rescue or renewed budget;
endif
note right
  First-side ACK reveals no queue to the other side.
  Timely result receipt and owner verification are distinct.
  Parsing, names and digests do not confer execution authority.
end note
stop
@enduml
